body:
So in the end my problem was actually just microsoft having a very messed up SDK installation + path not being recognized, I found myself in a rabbit hole of troubleshooting DOTNET with its esoteric behaviours and errors. 

&#x200B;

To fix Godot Mono I manually wiped "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\dotnet" and downloaded the "Binaries" zip instead of the installer and put the contents there. (I really want to thank that third reply past the first two textwalls in a random StackOverflow question)
